nd":"answer","from":"cam-3","to":"@investigator","incId":"inc-1","threadOf":"rc-6","text":"I'm looking into the window light; the jacket is in shadow. Navy is consistent with what I see."},{"id":"rc-10","t":1793481483611,"kind":"verdict","from":"investigator","to":"#incident-1","incId":"inc-1","text":"Person A, in a navy jacket and red beanie, came in through the entrance, picked up the yellow tote at the table and most likely left through the unwatched exit on the right. cam-3 read the jacket as black because it was backlit."},{"id":"rc-11","t":1793481491711,"kind":"knock","from":"guest-7f3a","to":"@site","text":"Wants to add footage: clip 14:17:37–14:17:47."},{"id":"rc-12","t":1793481497711,"kind":"admit","from":"site","to":"@guest-7f3a","incId":"inc-1","text":"Admitted to #incident-1. Clip aligned to site time by matching the bag pickup (±40 ms)."},{"id":"rc-13","t":1793481502911,"kind":"testimony","from":"guest-7f3a","to":"#incident-1","incId":"inc-1","threadOf":"rc-2","text":"14:17:43 Someone in a navy jacket with a yellow tote went out the side door by the stage."},{"id":"rc-14","t":1793481505911,"kind":"verdict","from":"investigator","to":"#incident-1","incId":"inc-1","text":"Revised: Person A, in a navy jacket and red beanie, came in through the entrance, picked up the yellow tote at the table and left through the side door by the stage, which no site camera covers. A guest's clip confirmed the exit."}]},"changed":[]}}
